  "conclusion": "corresponds",
  "rationale": "OpeningChecks.struct_field checks parcelClasses well-formedness, the class-only Parcel destructor signature, and its complete one-unpack body. The field type is shared SharedPoint, not Resource; the resulting point local remains initialized and shared while self is empty, and Finished is proved. Thus the prose contrast with Wrapper is specifically covered: class field obligations cannot be discarded, while a struct field local may remain at destructor return. The example shows a declaration/body, not a claimed complete main execution.",
  "limitations": [
    "Author self-review; no independent reviewer. Lean checks proof correctness separately. This review compares the cited statements, definitions and examples with the authored claims.",
    "The model has abstract syntax and noncomputable mathematical GC; no surface parser or executable collector is certified. Recursive execution need not terminate."
  ],
